# Berserker Stance and the Whirlwind weapon: The Islander and The Affray
# (1718, 1719, level 30), The Windwatcher (1791), Cyclonian with Essence of
# the Exile (1712, 1714), The Summoning (1713) and Whirlwind Weapon (1792,
# level 40).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# objectives, drops and places; Forever's Warrior class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and
# Forever's changes: The Affray now teaches Berserker Stance; Whirlwind Weapon
# lets you choose the Whirlwind Axe, Sword or Warhammer.
# The leveling guides take The Islander and The Affray on the route
# (alliance/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills and 40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale;
# horde/30-40/03-arathi-highlands); they are repeated here for anyone off it.
# The rest is left out of the leveling guides: it ends in an elite fight and
# runs from the Barrens to Alterac, Arathi and Stranglethorn.
# Level 30 and up is above the beta's level cap: this guide is written from
# the data, not from play.

step The Islander (Stormwind)
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 30, Wu Shen in Old Town, beside the Pig and Whistle, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens.
  level 30
  accept 1718 npc 5479                        -- Wu Shen

step The Islander (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 30, Kelv Sternhammer, the warrior trainer of Ironforge, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens.
  level 30
  accept 1718 npc 5113                        -- Kelv Sternhammer

step The Islander (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 30, Sorek in the Valley of Honor sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens.
  level 30
  accept 1718 npc 3354                        -- Sorek

step The Islander (Thunder Bluff)
  only Tauren
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip At 30, Torm Ragetotem, the warrior trainer of Thunder Bluff, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens.
  level 30
  accept 1718 npc 3041                        -- Torm Ragetotem

step The Islander (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 30, Baltus Fowler, a warrior trainer of the Undercity, sends you to Klannoc Macleod on Fray Island in the Barrens.
  level 30
  accept 1718 npc 4595                        -- Baltus Fowler

step The Affray
  zone The Barrens
  tip Head south along the coast from Ratchet to Fray Island. Klannoc Macleod stands by the arena: step on the grate to start the fight; the challengers come one at a time, then Big Will (33).
  turnin 1718                                 -- Klannoc Macleod
  accept 1719
  complete 1719                               -- Defeat the challengers and Big Will
  turnin 1719                                 -- Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance
  accept 1791

step Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Bath'rah the Windwatcher camps in the south-east of Alterac Mountains, above Hillsbrad Foothills; his cauldron stands beside him. He asks for a Liferoot, a Bloodscalp Tusk and the Essence of the Exile, which his cauldron brews from three charms.
  turnin 1791                                 -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  accept 1712
  accept 1714                                 -- Bath'rah's Cauldron

step The exiles of Arathi
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Three kinds of elemental exiles roam Arathi Highlands: Burning Exiles in the north-west, Thundering Exiles in the middle, Cresting Exiles in the north-east. Each drops its charm.
  collect 4479 quest 1714.2                   -- Burning Charm from the Burning Exiles
  collect 4480 quest 1714.1                   -- Thundering Charm from the Thundering Exiles
  collect 4481 quest 1714.3                   -- Cresting Charm from the Cresting Exiles

step Essence of the Exile
  zone Alterac Mountains
  turnin 1714                                 -- Bath'rah's Cauldron: Essence of the Exile
  collect 3357 quest 1712.1                   -- Liferoot: Herbalism, or the auction house

step Bloodscalp Tusk
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Bloodscalp trolls hold the north-west of Stranglethorn Vale; they drop the Bloodscalp Tusk.
  collect 3901 quest 1712.2                   -- Bloodscalp Tusk

step The Summoning
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Cyclonian waits just north of Bath'rah's camp and carries the Whirlwind Heart. Cyclonian is elite: grouping up is advised.
  turnin 1712                                 -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher
  accept 1713
  collect 6894 quest 1713.1                   -- Whirlwind Heart from Cyclonian
  turnin 1713
  accept 1792
  turnin 1792 choose 6975 6977 6976           -- Bath'rah the Windwatcher
